WEBVTT

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:34.950
Good morning!

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:36.230
Morning!

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:41.920
Yasumi! Wake up already!

00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:44.330
Okay, okay! I'm awake already.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.010
Morning, Yasumi.

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:50.330
Breakfast is ready.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:54.450
Don't joke with me! You're cooking in that white apron with your uniform!

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:55.830
W-Why!?

00:01:56.990 --> 00:02:02.790
A Wonderful Life

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:04.580
Thanks for the meal.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:13.400
What's this? If you're going to make lunch, make it bigger.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:16.040
No, you're wrong, that's...

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:17.140
Wrong?

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:27.280
Moriyama?

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:33.200
Stop! Stop! Why are you eating it! Stop!

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.690
Y-Y-You don't have to throw it back up!

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:37.600
Both of you go to school already!

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:45.370
W-Wait, Yasumi! Let's go together!

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:50.450
Yasumi! Hey, Yasumi!

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:52.580
Yasumi!

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:57.210
Crap.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.100
Hey, it wasn't on purpose okay?

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:09.840
W-What is it!?

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:11.570
W-Wait!

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:18.740
Please do not touch items on display.

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:23.540
What should we do? They're completely broken.

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:25.360
Ah, is it you, Natsu?

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:28.720
Yeah. Optical stores aren't open yet, right?

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:32.530
Ah, it's okay if it's only for a few days.

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:33.350
But...

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:36.130
If I squint I'll be able to see the blackboard.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:38.650
I see.

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:41.000
Well, I'll head to the store on the way back.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.420
Head to the store and...?

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:48.380
Hey, buy it for me! Buy it for me!

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:51.160
No. I already bought you one before.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:52.780
<Usage Precautions>

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:52.780
-Please do not pull or bend the figure's joints and clothes strongly.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:52.780
-Please do not place any of the figure's parts, tools, or packaging into your mouth.

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:52.950
This one's different from the other one!

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:55.510
I'm really sorry. We'll pay you back.

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:58.110
It's alright, I wasn't paying attention too.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:00.520
No, they're valuable.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:04.280
Yasumi, we're going to work at our store to save up money.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:06.530
Yasumi!

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:11.470
Well, if you want, you can pay me with your body.

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:13.070
How about it?

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:14.920
...or something like that!

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:19.050
That was just like him! You're really good, Nene!

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:24.520
Changes in old goods are not often announced ...

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:24.520
Please be understanding.

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:24.520
Please be careful of imitation goods.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:22.580
What was it again? It sounds like the name of an anime character.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:23.440
Pachimon?

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:24.780
Yeah! That's it!

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.100
Morning.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.400
Morning. You surprised me.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:32.060
Yeah, life with a slave is really nice.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:33.260
Mudo...

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:37.350
A Wonderful Slave Life: Mikan's Circumstances

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:40.850
Good morning. Time to wake up!

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:42.860
Here's your seconds.

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.420
Take care!

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.920
That's wrong! That's called a wife!

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.670
Enough already and shut up, okay?

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:55.730
A Wonderful Slave Life: Yasumi's Circumstances

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:00.970
Love, love!

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:09.730
He's unexpectedly passionate.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:13.810
A Wonderful Slave Life: Potemayo's Circumstances

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:39.650
In this scene, the feelings she's expressing are reaching even the heavens.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:47.190
There is no air in space, so hair and clothes do not flutter.

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:49.560
This scene is simply her imagination.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.510
Don't forget that we have to pay him back, okay?

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:05.590
I got it already! You're so annoying.

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:09.400
Hey! Hurry up or we'll be late!

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:10.670
Mudo...

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:14.920
Potemayo.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.090
Mudo...

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:33.560
You'll be late if you don't hurry, Mudo!

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.160
Safe!

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:45.800
Huh? Where's Moriyama-kun?

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:54.420
Oh? You're skipping school, boy?

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:57.870
It's not opening time yet, but today's special.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.550
Don't worry about it, order whatever you want!

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.000
Moriyama without his glasses, huh...

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.460
He really can't see anything.

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:09.610
Yeah. There was another time where he broke them.

00:07:10.010 --> 00:07:11.660
Was it during first year of middle school?

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:15.910
During lunch, he couldn't put a straw in his milk box.

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:20.830
That's right! That was a limited time special and it was really good!

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:23.320
What the heck are you talking about this time, stupid dog?

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:26.500
Moriyama-kun!

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.380
Oh! You're finally here.

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:30.200
Were you okay?

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:32.020
Ah, I was really lost.

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:33.980
Ultra Meat Attack

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:36.480
It must've been rough.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:40.960
Ah, you're here, Moriyama. Come by to the staff office later.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:45.770
Explosive Taiyaki Attack

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:02.310
Guchuko-chan!

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.850
Are you hungry?

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:07.970
Kyo-chan asked me to give you this!

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:12.620
I'll leave it here so eat it whenever you like, okay?

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.000
I'll take class notes for you okay?

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:57.420
I'll look out for you during gym then.

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.940
You're saying you want to do something too?

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:45.000
Does he feel bad if he doesn't decorate?

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.430
You made a lot.

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:56.340
They're intrusive in the class so let's hang them outside.

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:25.270
See you tomorrow.

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.630
See you!

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:33.110
Thanks for all your help today.

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:34.740
No, it was nothing.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.770
Having bad eyes is really inconvenient.

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:39.640
Not really.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:41.760
No, nothing.

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:47.000
Because of that, without being embarrassed like usual, I can---

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:52.930
"look at his face", is not what you're thinking, right, dimwit?

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:13.460
It's a bit sudden but, let's jump into summer!

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.940
See? Isn't it amazing?

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:35.420
Oh! You're all here?

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:38.660
I was waiting for you all.

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:41.730
Welcome to the Kasugano Residence.

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:48.730
Speaking of Summer, It's Pools

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:03.740
Alright! Let's go swimming!

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:12.760
1, 2, 3...

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:12.520
Young ones! Swim as much as you want.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.260
Amazing!

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.910
Alright! Let's go all out and swim!

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:42.010
She's sure energetic.

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:44.880
Takamimori-san really has a lot of stamina.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.900
Let's go too!

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:54.060
You're on lookout! Watch our stuff properly.

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:55.990
Who's on lookout!?

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:08.180
Moriyama's eyesight is 0.001.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:13.300
Consequently, this is what he currently sees.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:18.080
If he had put on his glasses, what he would see is...

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.230
M-Moriyama-kun! Are you okay?

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.430
He has a huge bump.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:29.010
Moriyama-kun! Moriyama-kun, get it together!

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:36.000
Moriyama-kun! Are you okay? Moriyama-kun!

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:41.030
What? You saved me, Natsu?

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:42.740
Moriyama-kun...

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:44.650
Thank you, Natsu.

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:46.260
Moriyama-kun...

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:54.180
Hello! Who may this be?

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:59.230
Hello...um...ah...Natsu...

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:02.750
What are you? A kid?

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:06.130
Are you okay?

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:07.970
Yeah, I think.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:24.240
Don't you think you should get that looked at?

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:26.980
Want me to bring you a first aid kit?

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.840
Want me to call you an ambulance?

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:48.190
Pote and the little bird should get along, okay?

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:54.810
Would you all like to have a drink?

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:13.530
Intruder Detected.

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:18.150
Warning. Warning. Eliminate the intruder immediately.

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:24.210
I repeat. Warning. Warning. Eliminate the intruder immediately.

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:27.170
I repeat. Warning. Warning.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:30.690
Crap!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:38.770
Alright! Push it already!

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:48.120
Everyone! The fruits have arrived so eat as much as you like.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.460
This is delicious.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:07.350
We still have a lot so eat up.

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.750
The taste is kind of rich.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:13.390
Yep. They're specially ordered end of the season crops.

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.580
I have no idea what the heck you're saying.

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:22.290
Thanks for inviting us today, Nene-chan.

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:24.300
It's livelier than usual.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.680
But it's really amazing that you have a pool at your house.

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:30.430
And it's so big.

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:35.340
Well yeah. that idiot's specialty is special make up and earning money.

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:37.080
I'll murder you, you little punk.

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:39.710
Um, who are you?

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:43.420
I'm Nene's mother, Kasugano Kira.

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:47.220
Talent Industry, Naomori Publishing, 46 years old.

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:48.610
46!?

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:49.440
What is it?

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:50.980
N-Nothing...

00:16:51.430 --> 00:16:53.350
Kasugano Kira, 19 years old.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:57.350
She made her debut as Naomori Publishing's youngest writer to win.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.930
Kasugano Kira, 32 years old.

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:03.400
The reason for her shocking divorce was because the sashimi was too old.

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:06.060
Kasugano Kira, 44 years old.

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:09.090
Her first nude photo collection issue was printed.

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:12.020
Special make up?

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:12.920
See?

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:15.260
Su-na-o.

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:21.440
It's good.

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:27.940
I thank you all for getting along with Nene.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:32.120
Geez, when it comes to it I just don't know what to do with this little punk.

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:35.620
I told you not to hit my face!

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:38.770
Shut up! Don't put your hand on my head like you're my friend.

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:41.240
Nene-chan's mom is pretty amazing.

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:40.440
Hey, I'm your parent!

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:45.200
No, no, no. Her brothers are even more amazing.

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:49.670
We're back, Nene-tan!

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:53.780
Your swimsuit is so cute! So cute! So cute!

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:54.100
See?

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:57.350
The eldest son, Matsuichi, defense attorney, 26 years old.

00:17:57.630 --> 00:18:00.090
You're playing with your friend at the pool today?

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:03.010
The second son, Takeji, tax counselor, 26 years old.

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:05.420
You should've told me, Nene-tan!

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:08.520
The third son, Umezo, prosecutor, 26 years old.

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:11.550
Mom told us to hurry up and come home.

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:13.740
Yes! So that you can be with us!

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:17.850
Nene-tan gave me a bleeding nose!

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.280
Damnit, Umezo!

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:20.600
I'm so jealous!

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:22.470
Hey, slave! Get me tea.

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:27.330
Ne-tan! Instead of that kid ask your brothers for help!

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:29.380
Let's see this one then.

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:31.960
I hate action movies.

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.000
Me too.

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:34.920
Then what do you want to see?

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:35.700
Anime?

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:36.870
Love story!

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:38.440
I don't like either of them.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.340
Then what are we going to do?

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:46.960
Then let's see one that's not action, anime or a love story.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:52.930
Hey, go with your brothers.

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:54.950
They're hating me.

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:57.060
You just don't get it.

00:18:58.140 --> 00:19:01.740
A dog that just wags its tail waiting for orders is boring.

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:10.310
Wagging tail would mean...

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:14.980
Nene-sama! Please order me around!

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:19.300
Stop using that dead brain of yours, idiot.

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:22.240
What's that! What do you mean idiot!?

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:24.190
Idiot means idiot!

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:28.460
Mudo...even if you say all that, you must really like Kasugano...

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:32.900
What's this loneliness I feel?

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:34.470
Hatsushiba!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.200
Geez!

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:38.180
Service.

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:41.800
This is going to be fun.

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:45.070
It's completely empty. We're the only customers.

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:47.720
I'm really bad with horror movies.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:50.430
Okay, that's good. Keep going.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:54.690
C'mon Pote! Just a little more.

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:02.390
Nene-tan! Get it together, Nene-tan! Nene-tan!

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:05.460
What the heck are you looking at, Matsuichi!?

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:08.680
Hey, what's going to happen to us!?

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:11.920
Calm down! Now that we're here, everything will be fine!

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:14.410
You're right. Everything will be okay, right!?

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:21.140
Go, Jason!

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:23.820
Alright, BBQ will be dinner!

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:27.450
Just grill whatever you like!

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:35.800
This is good! You have some good meat.

00:20:35.990 --> 00:20:38.550
Don't be so modest and eat up okay?

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:40.090
Yes!

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:43.220
Yo!

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:44.640
Here.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:46.470
Vodka.

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:57.000
That was interesting!

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:59.680
I won't be able to go to the toilet tonight!

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.240
Come on, let's go home.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.690
Tamaya!

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:11.130
Don't you have anything else to say, stupid dog?

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:14.290
Nene-tan! Nene-tan! Let's light some fireworks together!

00:21:14.550 --> 00:21:16.010
I'll do it with everyone over there.

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:21.220
Mudo!

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:26.140
Today was really fun, huh?

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:27.150
Yeah.

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:31.960
It's going to be one year soon...

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:35.450
...since the day I started talking to Moriyama-kun.

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:40.080
I pray that somehow days like this can continue.

00:21:40.970 --> 00:21:41.840
And...

00:21:43.970 --> 00:21:44.970
Suna-o!

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:47.110
That's not food.

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:50.350
I hope we can continue getting along well, Pote-chan.

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:54.010
Mudo!
